note [The Random library adds random numbers.]
add library "Random"

define 'secret' as a random number between 1 and 10
ask "I am thinking of a number between 1 and 10. Your guess?" and save the output as 'guess'

if 'guess' is equal to 'secret' then:
  say "You guessed it!"
else:
  say "No luck this time. The number was ", 'secret', "."
end if
